### 常见问题

* Authorization Failed 14009, 40191, You have NO privilege 'odps: CreateInstance'...

* 问题：绑定的aksk没有项目的CreateInstance权限
* 解决方案：申请权限：<https://guard.alibaba-inc.com/mark/mark.htm/#/projectApply/projectAuthApply>

* ODPS-0130161:[1,1] Parse exception - invalid token 'null'

* 问题：工具未绑定AK
* 解决方案：在工具配置中绑定AK

